# Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your Cloudflare credentials.

## Database

```
DATABASE_URL=file:./dev.db
DATABASE_ID=your-d1-database-id
DATABASE_BINDING=DB
```

## Cloudflare R2 (Storage)

```
R2_BUCKET_NAME=cfs-cms-dev
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-key
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret
R2_BINDING=BUCKET
```

## Cloudflare KV (Cache)

```
KV_NAMESPACE_ID=your-kv-id
KV_BINDING=KV
```

## Cloudflare API

```
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your-account-id
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your-api-token
```

## Application

```
APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
NODE_ENV=development
```

## Notes

- Get Cloudflare credentials from [Cloudflare Dashboard](https://dash.cloudflare.com/)
- See [docs/CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md](./docs/CLOUDFLARE_SETUP.md) for detailed setup instructions
- Never commit `.env.local` to version control (it's in `.gitignore`)
